  "domains": {
    "$comment": [
      "Textual value domains (plan P1-02): a byte-level regular expression (whole-string match) and a",
      "maximum UTF-8 length (0 = none). tools/gen-schema.mjs compiles each to a DFA for C++ (the ops",
      "reader's authoritative check) and to a RegExp for JS; \\x80-\\xff means any non-ASCII character."
    ],
    "ident": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_\\-]*"
    },
    "label": {
      "max": 512,
      "re": "[^\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+"
    },
    "lang": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "[A-Za-z]{2,8}(-[A-Za-z0-9]{1,8})*"
    },
    "rangeset": {
      "max": 0,
      "re": " *[0-9]{1,7} *(- *[0-9]{1,7} *)?(, *[0-9]{1,7} *(- *[0-9]{1,7} *)?)*"
    },
    "color": {
      "max": 64,
      "re": "#([0-9A-Fa-f]{3}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}|[0-9A-Fa-f]{8})|var\\(--[A-Za-z0-9_\\-]+\\)|(rgb|rgba|hsl|hsla)\\([0-9.,/ %deg\\-]*\\)|[A-Za-z]+"
    },
    "font": {
      "max": 512,
      "re": " *(\"[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+\" *|'[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+' *|[A-Za-z0-9_\\-\\x80-\\xff][A-Za-z0-9 _\\-\\x80-\\xff]*)(, *(\"[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+\" *|'[^\"'\\\\\\x00-\\x1f\\x7f]+' *|[A-Za-z0-9_\\-\\x80-\\xff][A-Za-z0-9 _\\-\\x80-\\xff]*))*"
    },
    "features": {
      "max": 256,
      "re": "( *(\"[A-Za-z0-9]{4}\"|'[A-Za-z0-9]{4}')( +(on|off|[0-9]{1,3}))?( *, *(\"[A-Za-z0-9]{4}\"|'[A-Za-z0-9]{4}')( +(on|off|[0-9]{1,3}))?)* *)?"
    }
  },
  "props": {
    "$comment": [
      "Run properties (plan P1-02; design T4 M2): one row per Styling field, in field order.",
      "type: bits (a flag set, ORed) | mul (size multiplier, composed by the engine) | str (an interned string) | px (absolute px).",
      "attr: the styled/STYLE_PUSH attribute that patches it (domain: that attribute's); sugar: boolean $.style.push keys setting one flag;",
      "dump: the label in the tree/block dumps; html: an attribute the typeset serializer writes;",
      "css + cssOrder: the declaration it writes (cssFlags: flag → keyword list; cssValue emPx: the run's em in px)."
    ],
    "text.bits": {
      "field": "bits",
      "type": "bits",
      "attr": "bits",
      "sugar": {
        "bold": "BOLD",
        "italic": "EM",
        "underline": "UNDER",
        "overline": "OVER",
        "strike": "STRIKE"
      },
      "css": "text-decoration",
      "cssOrder": 4,
      "cssFlags": {
        "UNDER": "underline",
        "OVER": "overline",
        "STRIKE": "line-through"
      }
    },
    "text.sizeMul": {
      "field": "sizeMul",
      "type": "mul"
    },
    "text.font": {
      "field": "fontFamily",
      "type": "str",
      "attr": "font",
      "dump": {
        "label": "font",
        "quoted": true
      },
      "css": "font-family",
      "cssOrder": 2
    },
    "text.lang": {
      "field": "lang",
      "type": "str",
      "attr": "lang",
      "dump": {
        "label": "lang"
      },
      "html": "lang"
    },
    "text.color": {
      "field": "color",
      "type": "str",
      "attr": "color",
      "dump": {
        "label": "color"
      },
      "css": "color",
      "cssOrder": 3
    },
    "text.size": {
      "field": "sizePx",
      "type": "px",
      "attr": "sizePx",
      "dump": {
        "label": "size"
      },
      "css": "font-size",
      "cssOrder": 1,
      "cssValue": "emPx"
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "$comment": [
      "Host settings (plan P1-03; design T4 M3 / T9 A4): one row per setting, by dotted path.",
      "field: the Config member (cost.* fill CostParams); dom: value domain (a domains entry, num:LO:HI, int:LO:HI, bool,",
      "enum:A|B, str, map); def: default; prec: HostOnly | HostDefault | HostForce | DocOnly (no document layer before P3);",
      "affects: the stages (stages.def) whose products the setting changes — the first one decides whether a patch",
      "applies in place or the document is rebuilt; legacy: the createEngine/tsr_* option it replaces (MD-06).",
      "terms.* override single locale words (semantic/terms.h, plan P1-10); unset, the document language's locale pack decides.",
      "optional: an empty string is accepted (the row is unset and resolution falls through)."
    ],
